class="sourceCode python"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb7-1"><a href="#cb7-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="op">!</span>pandoc <span class="op">-</span>f docx <span class="op">-</span>t markdown_strict<span class="op">+</span>pipe_tables <span class="st">&quot;PRISMA NMA checklist.docx&quot;</span> <span class="op">-</span>o prisma<span class="op">-</span>nma.md </span></code></pre></div>
